*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : INT0041
*> PURPOSE : INTEREST TIERS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : A.W.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1987-01-18 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-11-01 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 935
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB INTNIGHT STEP020
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. INT0041.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    *> CUSTOMER AGE IN YEARS
    05 CA-AGE             PIC 9(3).
    *> CURRENT LEDGER BALANCE
    05 WS-BAL             PIC 9(9)V99.
    *> ACCOUNT TYPE S=SAVINGS C=CHECKING P=PREMIUM G=GOLD B=BUSINESS F=FIXED
    05 WS-ATYP            PIC X.
    *> BASE INTEREST RATE
    05 BR-RT              PIC 9V9999.
    05 PROC-DATE          PIC 9(8).
    05 PROC-DATE-R REDEFINES PROC-DATE.
       10 PROC-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 PROC-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 PROC-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(6).
01 RESULT-AREA.
    05 WS-BNR             PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM APPLY-BONUS
    PERFORM 2600-FIXED-DEP
    DISPLAY "WS-BNR=" WS-BNR
    STOP RUN.
APPLY-BONUS.
    *> SENIOR SAVER BONUS - LIMIT 41 PER 1998 POLICY
    IF CA-AGE >= 55 AND WS-BAL >= 5000
        COMPUTE WS-BNR ROUNDED = BR-RT + 0.0050
    ELSE
        MOVE BR-RT TO WS-BNR
    END-IF.
2600-FIXED-DEP.
    *> FIXED DEPOSIT UPLIFT
    IF WS-ATYP = 'F'
        COMPUTE WS-BNR = WS-BNR + 0.0010
    END-IF.
